was a blessing for Xue Yue.

35
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:32,440
I took Red Butterfly as my disciple

36
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:36,090
in order to investigate the origin of the elemental spirits.

37
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,760
But through divination,

38
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:40,720
I foresaw that Red Butterfly

39
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,320
will soon encounter a death disaster.

40
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:49,160
The night before

41
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:49,160
Xue Yue attacks

42
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:49,160
the Four Sect Alliance

43
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:49,720
Qing He,

44
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:51,920
in this battle,

45
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:55,640
Chong Ying\NXue Yue\NLate stage Soul Formation

46
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:55,520
you will take Red Butterfly's elemental spirits

47
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:57,120
