48
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,960
in the Four Sect Alliance's territory.

49
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:01,400
Master...

50
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:02,080
Qing He\NXue Yue\NLate stage Soul Formation

51
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,040
The other day,

52
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:07,080
red mist envelopped my old body

53
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:10,400
as I predicted that Red Butterfly's death

54
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:12,680
will happen in this war.

55
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:16,920
If you cannot help her overcome her fate,

56
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:20,840
Red Butterfly will be dead by the end of the war.

57
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,920
That way, in the future,

58
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,640
she will be safe.

59
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:33,280
Master...

60
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:37,160
Red Butterfly has only been with you for 100 years.

61
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,120
But I...

62
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,160
I am your first disciple !

63
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:55,760
Master !

64
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:56,920
What's wrong ?

65
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:02,120
This last divination spell

66
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:05,600
has exhausted my remaining lifespan.

67
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:09,240
But I had no other choice...

68
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,280
Qing He,

69
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:15,200
don't blame your Master.

70
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:20,360
Xue Yu has been trapped in this barren land

71
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:22,240
for far too long.

72
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,600
You are now the Elder Sister of Xue Yue.

73
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,960
Protecting Red Butterfly

74
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:31,080
also means

75
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,520
protecting our Xue Yue.

76
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:37,360
The future...

77
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:38,640
Master !

78
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,840
Master !!

79
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:42,320
Master !!!

80
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,040
Master...

81
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:53,160
Master...

82
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,240
Disciple

83
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:08,240
accepts your order.

84
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,560
Go, go faster !

85
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:50,320
You monsters, get wrecked !

86
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,720
Lord Envoy,

87
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,640
the country of Suzaku promised

88
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,400
that they would help me once.

89
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:15,680
So now...

90
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,960
Please kill this Azure Dragon !

91
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,040
She's alive ?!

92
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:23,400
I have no right to kill this dragon.

93
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:23,840
Ou Zhi\NEnvoy of the country of Suzaku \NEarly stage Soul Transformation

94
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,480
Soul Transformation ?!

95
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,880
But taking out his blood

96
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:29,440
to stop him from causing trouble,

97
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,640
that is something I can do.

98
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:04,960
I turns out our opponent

99
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,520
has never been Red Butterfly...

100
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:09,080
but the country of Suzaku...

101
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:18,720
From now on,

102
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:22,640
you won't have to worry about this dragon.

103
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:34,630
The Guardian Azure Dragon... has lost.

104
00:07:34,650 --> 00:07:36,000
Get out of the way !

105
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,280
Go ! Quick !

106
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,160
With the fall of the Guardian Azure Dragon,

107
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:52,360
the Four Sect Alliance has lost.

108
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:54,680
The outcome of the war is certain.

109
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:05,700
Five spirits,

110
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,740
attack !

111
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,880
One is missing ?

112
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:50,920
Zhou Yun !

113
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,000
Elder !

114
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:30,940
Fortunately, the Heaven Defying Bead can absorb elemental spirits.

115
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,840
Otherwise, I'd have no way to survive.

116
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,320
Zhou Wutai just left the battlefield...

117
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:40,800
This is my only chance to get the Rain Cauldron.

118
00:09:58,560 --> 00:09:59,760
This domain...

119
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:09,840
I didn't expect to see you here,

120
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:10,920
Brother Wang.

121
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:25,440
This Rain Cauldron is too precious

122
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,840
for me to hold.

123
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:31,000
It's too precious for our Four Sect Alliance.

124
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,560
If you want it, you can take it.

125
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,240
But whether you can keep it

126
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:39,040
will depend on your own luck.

127
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,830
Take one pill per day

128
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,320
and you will recover.

129
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,080
With the Rain Cauldron in hand,

130
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,400
I have to get out of here.

131
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,000
This is bad !

132
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,320
The remnants of the Four Sect Alliance,

133
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:12,440
Lian Ning \NXue Yue Elder\NEarly stage Soul Formation

134
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:12,640
must die !

135
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,120
Explode !

136
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,160
I won't let you leave !

137
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:08,530
Although she is Soul Formation,

138
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:11,160
her physical body is not necessarily strong.

139
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,800
With Ancient God blood,

140
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,640
I might have a chance.

141
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:30,640
This Nascent Soul puppet of yours

142
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:32,920
is pretty interesting.

143
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:45,560
Explode !

144
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:51,000
If I don't escape now,

145
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:53,720
it will only get harder in the future.

146
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:56,800
The only way to end this quickly

147
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:58,040
is a tribulation.

148
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:22,480
This is...

149
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:24,720
Divine Retribution !

150
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:34,520
How can a Nascent Soul brat

151
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:36,200
summon such a tribulation !?

152
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:42,640
Fall !

153
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:11,920
I am Ou Zhi from Suzaku.

154
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:14,960
Fellow cultivator, please summon the tribulation again !

155
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:17,520
I will reward you generously !

156
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:22,400
It really was Divine Retribution...

157
00:14:22,620 --> 00:14:23,360
Fellow cultivator,

158
00:14:23,680 --> 00:14:25,440
are you willing to show yourself ?

159
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:27,440
Killing this one Soul Formation

160
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:29,320
consumed all my artifacts.

161
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:31,040
I must not interfere

162
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:32,760
with the country of Suzaku.

163
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:38,360
The fall of the Guardian Azure Dragon

164
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:40,840
signed the end of the Four Sect Alliance.

165
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:43,560
The country was destroyed.

166
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:45,920
In the following years,

167
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:51,800
the remaining cultivators of the Four Sects Alliance almost all perished.

168
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:54,080
Those who survived

169
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,880
must hide their identity

170
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,840
in the new Xue Yue country

171
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:01,520
in order to survive.

172
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:09,160
5 years later

173
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:17,440
After absorbing the earth spirit,

174
00:15:17,470 --> 00:15:18,920
the earth element has been completed.

175
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,740
Now the Heaven Defying Bead

176
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:24,080
has a bit of spiritual energy inside it.

177
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:27,360
These 5 elemental lights have hints of Life.

178
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:30,180
The Heaven Defying Bead

179
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:32,040
must have uses I have yet to discover.

180
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:34,720
I have to complete the 5 elements first.

181
00:15:35,380 --> 00:15:37,960
Only then will the bead recognize me as its master

182
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:40,280
and maybe reveal its other powers.

183
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,120
To cultivate the Life and Death Domain,

184
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:46,440
the time alteration of the Heaven Defying Bead

185
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:48,320
is useless.

186
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,640
After 5 years, I cannot stay inside any longer.

187
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:53,440
I still need 4 years

188
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:56,000
before I can step into Soul Formation.

189
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:05,000
New Xue Yue

190
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,040
In just 5 years,

191
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:11,000
Xue Yue has developed to this point.

192
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:54,960
This is...

193
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:56,720
A death aura ?

194
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:58,920
There are many mortals here,

195
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:01,480
they should be brimming with life.

196
00:17:02,070 --> 00:17:05,200
So why is this death aura so prevalent ?

197
00:17:08,850 --> 00:19:55,010
Wang Lin only has a limited number of Void Ink Stones to craft Restriction Flags. Using a flag's tribulation if his last resort. Previously, he was hit by a tribulation and refined some Divine Retribution lightning by pure fluke. He used that lightning in episode 52 to attack Lin Yi, the Soul Formation envoy in Zhao.\NTrying to refine lightning once again would be completely crazy and a waste of ressources for Wang Lin.

198
00:17:16,780 --> 00:17:20,660
I've had my share of wounds,

199
00:17:18,820 --> 00:17:20,660
now I want to fight back.

200
00:17:20,740 --> 00:17:24,220
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

201
00:17:24,300 --> 00:17:30,140
that's blocking all my hopes

202
00:17:27,180 --> 00:17:30,140
for life ?

203
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:35,900
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

204
00:17:33,660 --> 00:17:35,900
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

205
00:17:36,220 --> 00:17:39,300
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

206
00:17:39,660 --> 00:17:45,300
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

207
00:17:42,380 --> 00:17:45,300
out of reach.

208
00:17:46,660 --> 00:17:50,780
Immortals

209
00:17:47,700 --> 00:17:50,780
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

210
00:17:51,060 --> 00:17:54,820
Renegades

211
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:54,820
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

212
00:17:54,820 --> 00:17:58,660
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

213
00:17:56,770 --> 00:17:58,660
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

214
00:17:58,900 --> 00:18:02,780
because I don't see the harm in that.

215
00:18:04,780 --> 00:18:10,580
My new body opens its eyes

216
00:18:07,300 --> 00:18:10,580
and awakens from its dream.

217
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:18,140
I have overcome many trials

218
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:18,140
to get this body back.

219
00:18:18,340 --> 00:18:25,780
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

220
00:18:22,380 --> 00:18:25,780
I can still see.

221
00:18:26,180 --> 00:18:35,140
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

222
00:18:30,140 --> 00:18:35,140
by my own hands.

223
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:11,980
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

224
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:11,980
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

225
00:19:11,980 --> 00:19:19,540
With a flick of a finger,

226
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:19,540
only my indomitable heart remains.

227
00:19:19,580 --> 00:19:28,940
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

228
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:28,940
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

229
00:19:29,180 --> 00:19:36,780
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

230
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:36,780
like the descent of a god.
